AoU-LR patch to FELIX v0.1 (lhu1/felix@sha256:63c1e1d63aa029bc00403547b05554448c71d3b64164a16b93acb66a0ebeab88).

Opt-in carrier-count QC for the admixed single-variant VCF path
(mainMarkerAdmixedInCPP, genoType "vcf"). Set FELIX_DOSAGE_QC=carrier in
the environment of step2_SPAtests.R. The minMAC / minMAF / MACCutoffforER
checks then use the number of samples with a non-zero DS{k} (and those
without) among samples carrying an ancestry-k haplotype, instead of sum(DS{k})
treated as an allele count. Needed for REF-relative repeat-length dosages,
which can be negative. Off by default; FELIXla input is untouched.

Design and validation: felix/SV_SCORER_DESIGN.md.
Apply from /app with: patch -p1 < 0001-dosage-carrier-qc.patch

